Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sandstorm Destroys the Inn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 18
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.87,0:00:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, what is our mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.59,0:00:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The drones I sent detected
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This place also has this energy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Next
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You two go to this place to find this energy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and bring it back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.64,0:00:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take the equipment I gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,be safe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.65,0:01:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When can we catch up with Blue Scarf?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf is notoriously cautious
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.84,0:01:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She basically has no flaws
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But speaking of it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.56,0:01:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we catch up with her
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,we’ll still have to find a way to sneak up on her then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.60,0:01:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t your boss very powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to sneak attack on her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Our boss uses miasma
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.05,0:01:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Although the frontal combat capability is not the strongest,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.61,0:01:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,once you fall into his miasma
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.97,0:01:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You will suffer the pain of losing sight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.08,0:01:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and then slowly collapse
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.61,0:01:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Blue Scarf?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.65,0:01:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.97,0:01:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Because she’s so powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone sees her as a thorn in their side
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.52,0:01:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So she has the most water reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Able to easily neutralize other people’s attacks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.61,0:01:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can confront her head on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.44,0:01:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And it is said that she is ruthless
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.92,0:01:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She once could destroy a town by herself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.90,0:02:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy a town by herself
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too exaggerated
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.85,0:02:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Her whereabouts are mysterious
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.37,0:02:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Extremely cautious
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.73,0:02:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Only does tasks with the highest bounty
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.09,0:02:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And never fails
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You know so much
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I only recently became Boss’s subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.00,0:02:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to become Boss’s right-hand man
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I work hard every day on learning these things
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.79,0:02:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The one in front
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.15,0:02:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Blue Scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.28,0:02:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s really her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.24,0:02:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally at her speed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.56,0:02:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s no way we can catch up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s because of that little girl
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.07,0:02:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister, please drive slower
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m still so dizzy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.15,0:02:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we take a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.07,0:03:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a fever
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a place where we can rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So boring
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any gossip?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.94,0:03:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha Erlang and Blue Scarf have a new feud going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.25,0:03:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to be over a young girl with a bounty from Guangzong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re both top-tier fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.66,0:03:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think will win?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.70,0:03:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s definitely got to be the formidable Blue Scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll give you one chance to say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.23,0:03:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who’s the strongest?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.63,0:03:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss is definitely the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because no matter who comes to the inn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.68,0:03:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They will all be defeated by Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:03:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:04:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Our boss’s sonic shockwave
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.11,0:04:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,knocks anyone unconscious
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Be it Blue Scarf or Cha Erlang
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,none of them make it out alive
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that’s more like it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.20,0:04:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you are our
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,100th customer this month
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,we have free—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.92,0:04:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We don’t need water or food
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one room
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. There are plenty of good rooms
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our invincible sand view room
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Spacious and comfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.73,0:04:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We don’t want this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.53,0:04:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.49,0:04:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What about this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t want this kind of room
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,no problem
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.05,0:04:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We have other rooms
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll stay in his room
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.73,0:04:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Live in my dormitory?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.48,0:05:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Guest, you really know how to joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How can staff dormitories be as good as guest rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay okay okay
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.73,0:05:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve never seen such strange guests as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.85,0:05:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So you want to eat shaved ice
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you tell me earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.16,0:05:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll arrange it now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My sound waves are put into every piece of ice
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just eat
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and it will knock you out right away
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a little trick
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Applying this will help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.68,0:05:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,where are we
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong with me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,you have a fever
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.91,0:06:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,we rest here tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re just valuable
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.43,0:06:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t get me wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.91,0:06:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have fallen asleep
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.55,0:06:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We are ready to take action
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.32,0:06:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The third performance today
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Toss the ball
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There are also performances here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s him, it’s her
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the boss here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.53,0:06:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.49,0:06:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Distinguished guests are dusty
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and warm up with a cup of hot tea
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Except for us today
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.49,0:06:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there any other guests here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.33,0:06:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Guests’ information
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.41,0:06:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t reveal it casually
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t you have a drink first?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not thirsty
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll tell you after you drink it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.61,0:07:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you say it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this guest tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.16,0:07:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to stay in our invincible sand view room?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.81,0:07:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We both know who the other really is,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.69,0:07:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I advise you to leave early.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this inn owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe her combat prowess rivals that of our boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,According to many,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,if you step into her inn,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you’ll wake up in the desert the next day
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,with absolutely nothing left on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.39,0:07:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over the guests staying here and do it quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.52,0:07:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I get out of handing them over to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.07,0:07:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The benefit is not getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.99,0:07:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not your place to run wild here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.91,0:07:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then come and try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.44,0:07:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on, come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:07:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What to do now
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.80,0:08:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t matter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The more chaotic the situation, the easier it is to fish in troubled waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.84,0:08:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.34,0:08:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let them get into chaos and we’ll take the opportunity to rob people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.37,0:08:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.21,0:08:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you doing
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.93,0:08:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you say there was going to be chaos?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this kind of chaos
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t we cooperate first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I tell you frankly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The other side is Blue Scarf and Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.21,0:08:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we team up to defeat Blue Scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.09,0:08:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and split the bounty equally?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.17,0:08:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out that person is Blue Scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder it’s so difficult to deal with
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.01,0:08:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember to split the bounty equally
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,make a deal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.77,0:08:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The movement just now won’t alarm them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, my soundproofing is very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What was the sound just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.89,0:09:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to get a little better
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.93,0:09:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then prepare
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.61,0:09:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What to prepare
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.81,0:09:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,ready to leave at any time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.07,0:09:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,what sound
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,we chase
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We also chase
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.60,0:09:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, we also chase
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel a little strange
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.49,0:09:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging from the suspension height of the motorcycle just now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.12,0:09:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s different from before
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There were probably not two people on the motorcycle just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.24,0:10:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That Blue Scarf wants to lure us away on her own
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, so cautious she is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.73,0:10:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did she suddenly take the risk and leave Xiao Mei behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of them left
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.01,0:10:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,behind the box
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.57,0:10:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Good eyesight
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t aim here next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:10:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We will definitely rescue Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That depends on whether you have the ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Same equipment as me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even have the ability to copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.60,0:11:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s getting more and more interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.99,0:11:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Power is okay
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But the heat is still lacking
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Here Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.39,0:11:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to catch her before Cha Erlang finds out he’s been tricked and comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.09,0:11:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t leave
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done. You are truly worthy of being my subordinates.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
